{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2023-04-27 18:02:00', 'title': "STATE STREET TO PARTICIPATE IN AUTONOMOUS BERNSTEIN'S 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS CHAIRMAN & CEO, RON O'HANLEY, AND VICE CHAIRMAN & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, ERIC ABOAF, WILL PARTICIPATE IN AUTONOMOUS BERNSTEIN'S 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 31, 2023 AT 9:00 AM ET. AN AUDIO WEBCAST WILL BE ACCESSIBLE ON THE HOME PAGE OF STATE STREET'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE, INVESTORS.STATESTREET.COM. A RECORDED REPLAY WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE INVESTOR."}